      <h2>Your team can sell. It needs more of the right conversations.</h2>
      <div class="sdr-fit-grid">
        <article><h3>Founder-led and lean teams</h3><p>You can close good opportunities, but prospecting, list work, and follow-up compete with everything else.</p></article>
        <article><h3>SaaS, technology and B2B services</h3><p>Your offer needs the right buyer, a clear business reason, thoughtful qualification, and a useful handoff.</p></article>
        <article><h3>New segments and markets</h3><p>You want real buyer feedback before committing to a larger internal sales development team.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="sdr-readiness"><strong>Bring an offer you can stand behind and a team ready to follow through.</strong><p>We need a definable buyer, credible proof, timely approvals, and people available for meetings. If those foundations are missing, we should address them before starting outreach.</p></div>
